1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,730
Dear Obit Billionaires, join

2
00:00:01,730 --> 00:00:03,060
us in this work hour prayer.

3
00:00:03,130 --> 00:00:04,180
Repeat after me.

4
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:07,880
I welcome this working hour.

5
00:00:10,317 --> 00:00:11,573
I breathe and settle.

6
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:15,330
I choose one clear task.

7
00:00:17,786 --> 00:00:18,884
I begin with care.

8
00:00:21,141 --> 00:00:22,461
My attention has value.

9
00:00:24,868 --> 00:00:25,658
I put distractions

10
00:00:25,658 --> 00:00:26,558
aside.

11
00:00:28,559 --> 00:00:29,869
I work at a steady pace.

12
00:00:32,326 --> 00:00:33,566
I give each step thought.

13
00:00:35,824 --> 00:00:36,994
I ask when I am unsure.

14
00:00:39,360 --> 00:00:40,667
I listen before I answer.

15
00:00:42,923 --> 00:00:44,063
I speak with patience.

16
00:00:46,490 --> 00:00:47,800
I treat people with respect.

17
00:00:50,061 --> 00:00:50,961
I keep my word.

18
00:00:53,378 --> 00:00:54,608
I ask for help early.

19
00:00:56,869 --> 00:00:58,289
I welcome useful correction.

20
00:01:00,735 --> 00:01:02,045
I learn without losing heart.

21
00:01:04,306 --> 00:01:05,356
I can begin again.

22
00:01:07,893 --> 00:01:09,312
I notice small progress.

23
00:01:11,569 --> 00:01:12,789
I take rest when needed.

24
00:01:15,245 --> 00:01:16,785
I return with fresh attention.

25
00:01:19,045 --> 00:01:19,665
I appreciate

26
00:01:19,665 --> 00:01:20,565
those beside me.

27
00:01:23,022 --> 00:01:24,591
I use my skills honestly.

28
00:01:26,898 --> 00:01:28,418
I welcome fair opportunities.

29
00:01:30,894 --> 00:01:32,154
I keep clear records.

30
00:01:34,413 --> 00:01:35,833
I leave my work in order.

31
00:01:38,379 --> 00:01:40,116
I make room for cooperation.

32
00:01:42,372 --> 00:01:42,922
I release

33
00:01:42,922 --> 00:01:44,412
unnecessary conflict.

34
00:01:47,089 --> 00:01:48,809
I finish one useful step.

35
00:01:51,068 --> 00:01:52,738
I encourage someone today.

36
00:01:55,515 --> 00:01:56,295
I continue with

37
00:01:56,295 --> 00:01:57,385
purpose and hope.
